# Storage Admin UI patterns

## Lists
Use DataGrid stack from `@workspace/ui`: `DataGrid`, `DataGridContainer`, `DataGridTable`, `DataGridTableContainer`, `DataGridPagination`, `DataGridColumnHeader`, `useDataTable`, `DataTableToolbar`.

## Forms
Create/edit forms MUST use `ResponsiveSheet` (not Dialog). Destructive actions use AlertDialog / ConfirmDialog.

## Auth
- Admin cookie: `storage_admin_session` (iron-session). Never store API keys in the browser.
- Core HTTP and SDK use `x-api-key` only. Admin uses JWT via BFF `/api/upstream`.

## Features layout
`features/<domain>/{hooks,columns,components}` — thin route pages under `app/(admin)/(main)/`.
